#tr.en: Hardly had she spoken these words when he said, @q[Dumuzid,Jectin-ana]{“Sister, go up onto the mound, sister, go up onto the mound! Sister, when you go up onto the mound, do not go up onto the mound like an ordinary person, but lacerate @varh[t143.v10]{your heart } @vart[t143.v11,t143.v11]{@varn{1 ms. has instead:} your hair } and your liver, lacerate your clothes and your crotch, sister, and then go up onto the mound! Sister, when you go up onto the mound, look out from the mound! The evil ……, hated by men, …… a river barge! They hold in their hands the wood to bind the hands, they are identified (?) from the wood to bind the neck -- no man knows how to undo it!”} 
#etcsl: line-id=70

